+5. Orthonormaler Satz in 3D
+In 3D sind die Standardbasisvektoren:
+
+„{Python}“
+i = np.array([1,0,0])
+j = np.array([0,1,0])
+k = np.array([0,0,1])
+
+print("‖i‖ =", np.linalg.norm(i))
+print("‖j‖ =", np.linalg.norm(j))
+print("‖k‖ =", np.linalg.norm(k))
+print("i·j =", np.dot(i,j))
